{"about_the_game":"Seven Steps to Return is a challenging 2D platform game with pixel art aesthetics, where each jump and each fall brings you closer to the truth behind a story full of pain, hope and memory. Accompany Kailo, a dog marked by past wounds, and traverse stormy, celestial and desolate worlds that reflect his emotional journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore hostile environments, overcome relentless obstacles, and unravel a hidden truth as you meet Nero, a mysterious guide cat with intentions as uncertain as his origins. Each step brings you closer to the end... and not everyone is prepared to know it.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117790?t=1763560796","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117790?t=1763560796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117790/f38bf4fefcec49f1d53daa0e663abda600c1e85f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763560796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117790/f38bf4fefcec49f1d53daa0e663abda600c1e85f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763560796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Seven Steps to Return is a challenging 2D platform game with pixel art aesthetics, where each jump and each fall brings you closer to the truth behind a story full of pain, hope and memory. Accompany Kailo, a dog marked by past wounds, and traverse stormy, celestial and desolate worlds that reflect his emotional journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore hostile environments, overcome relentless obstacles, and unravel a hidden truth as you meet Nero, a mysterious guide cat with intentions as uncertain as his origins. Each step brings you closer to the end... and not everyone is prepar